# The generated native projects.
#
# `npx cap add ios` and `npx cap add android` copy a project template that is
# several hundred files, a good number of them binary: a Gradle wrapper JAR,
# placeholder launcher PNGs, Xcode asset catalogues. This repository has no
# binary assets in it and that is not negotiable (ADR-0002), so the generated
# trees stay out and are regenerated on the machine that builds them, with
# `scripts/native-assets.mjs` immediately redrawing every image from code.
#
# See README.md for the argument, and for what has to change before this line
# comes back out.
ios/
android/

# Where `npm run assets:preview` writes, for looking at.
.preview/
